// Every card in the current Recusant Crown set, in collector-number order.
//
// To add or update a card: put its art in assets/card-art/ and add or edit
// its line below. The site draws every card from this list (see
// card-render.js), so the Library, downloads, print sheets and the spoiler
// carousel always show the current text; nothing else needs editing.
// assets/cards/ holds the older finished images, used only as a fallback.
//
// Keep names identical everywhere so a card can always be found:
//   number  the collector number printed at the bottom of the card
//           (Alpha-r1-#0001 is 1). Hundreds mark the faction:
//           0xx Dream (blue), 1xx Resolve (red), 2xx Dark (purple),
//           3xx Light (gold), 4xx Essence (neutral)
//   set     the set and revision printed before the number, e.g. "Alpha-r1".
//           Starting a new revision in the card editor moves every card to
//           it and keeps the old one as a GitHub tag (e.g. alpha-r1), so each
//           revision's cards and art stay findable.
//   name    exactly as printed in the card's title bar, punctuation included
//   image   assets/cards/<4-digit number>-<name>.jpg: the name in lower
//           case, punctuation dropped, spaces as hyphens
//           e.g. #0029 "Seer's Staff" -> 0029-seers-staff.jpg
//           The card's art uses the same name in assets/card-art/ (art only,
//           1000 x 620, cropped to the card's art window). Rename both files
//           when a card's name changes.
//   art     true once the card has finished art; only these appear in the
//           random spoiler carousel (the Library shows every card). Every
//           card in the illustrated alpha set (Oct 2026) is true. A card
//           with art false is drawn with an empty "Art to come" window.
//   text    rules text, then any closing "quotation" as flavour text. Symbols
//           can go in it: {Light} {Insight} {Resolve} {Ink} (or ⚪ 🔵 🔴 ⚫)
//           for a faction's own symbol, {Essence} for the grey circle
//           (Essence only), {Any} for the Essence cross (any resource), and
//           {Essence Ink} etc. for the grey circle with that faction's circle
//           orbiting it. {Power 1} and {Bounty 0} draw the Power starburst or
//           Bounty circle with that number inside, and {Insight 2},
//           {Essence 1} etc. put the number inside that faction's symbol.
//   bountyFaction  only on a creature whose bounty pays a faction's Clarity
//           instead of Essence ("Light", "Dream", "Resolve" or "Dark"); its
//           bounty then shows that faction's symbol, not the grey circle
//   artist  the art credit printed in the footer ("Art: ..."); left out
//           when not known yet, which prints "Art: TBD"
//   factions  only on multicolor cards: every faction the card uses, its
//           main faction first, e.g. ["Dream", "Resolve"]. The cost badge
//           shows each one's circle; the card uses the Essence background
//           until multicolor backgrounds exist. faction stays the main one
//           (its number block, Library filters).
//   imagePending  true when the text below has changed since the old image
//           file was made (Edit Queue rounds 1-4, Oct 2026). Only matters
//           when a card can't be drawn and the old image is shown instead.
//
// The rest comes from the set spreadsheet (Recusant_Set_1_Draft), matched by
// collector number, then checked against the illustrated alpha renders
// (costs of #0411-0413, Tripwire's text and #0411-0416 type lines and Roll Over's text updated by hand): faction, kind (Spell or Entity), cost ("X" for X-cost
// cards), type line, rarity, rules text, and for entities bloom, power and
// bounty ("{Majesty}" where the card prints the Majesty crown instead of a
// bounty, as every Rival does).
// The Library's filters and search use these.
//
// The image is also the file people download and print.
